	(text_box "* consider SGL1-20 to replace RBS1MM40A b/c tariff\n\nAUX PCB\n~{       }\n* control switches\n	* PWR\n	* FAN SPD\n* indicators\n	* FAULT\n	* PWR\n	* WHATEVER\n* I_{2}C display"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 257.81 0)
		(size 23.622 22.8599)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 0 0 0 0)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Ac437 ATI 8x8")
				(size 0.7 0.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "10ed725d-d604-40fd-a741-87c72bbcaeb9")
	)
	(text_box "REMARKS\n~{       }\n* assembled PCB is about 8mm thick.  Probably same for the horizonally-mounted version.\n* external components not needed apparently, but probably should add electrolytic cap on input due to length of power input cable; assume someone could connect a cable with 6ft from the connector to the wall wart\n* on-board capacitors: 2x100uF input, 1x1000uF \"C_{bus}\" which i assume is the output because they provide no explanation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 33.02 0)
		(size 23.622 26.6699)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 0 0 0 0)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Ac437 ATI 8x8")
				(size 0.7 0.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "459e4c94-09c2-44f6-b382-6584207a115a")
	)
	(text_box "calculator: https://www.ti.com/tool/download/TPS25948-CALC\n\nOVP SETTING\nV_{IN(OV)} = V_{OV(R)} x (R1 + R2) / R2\n\nOUTPUT RISE TIME\nslew rate: SR(V/ms) = VIN(V) / tR(ms)\n\nC_{dVdt}(pF) = 5000 / SR(V/ms)\nnearest standard capacitor value as 3000pF\n\ninrush current: I_{INRUSH}(mA) = SR(V/ms) x COUT(uF)\npower dissipation during inrush: PD_{INRUSH}(W) = I_{INRUSH}(A) x VIN(V) / 2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 31.75 0)
		(size 63.5 31.75)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f96aa7d4-a852-4117-a762-e9e0a37da96f")
